{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>It's a Free DLC with a new map and new fish species. We want to say &quot;Thank You&quot; to everyone who supported this project through its hard &amp; good times. Thank you for being with us!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830830/extras/Delaware-_0000s_0001_Zrzut_ekranu_2025-05-30_215613-min_\u2014_kopia.jpg?t=1748639290\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delaware Bay is a coastal estuary located between New Jersey and Delaware, home to a diverse array of saltwater fish. Anglers can catch flathead grey mullet, battle mid-sized fighters like striped bass and black drum, or take on ocean predators such as Atlantic blue marlin, blacktip sharks, and spinner sharks. A true saltwater challenge!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fish Species:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spinner shark</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blacktip shark</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dusky shark</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sandbar shark</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Silky shark</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Great barracuda</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Red drum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Black drum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Striped bass</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blackfin tuna</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yellowfin tuna</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Little tunny</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blue marlin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mahi-mahi</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Black sea bass</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flathead grey mullet</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2830830?t=1748639290","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830830/7b719bd34ebbfbce7d8101bd27d087e84028f38